{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q18209997","formula":"C₁₁H₁₅N₅O₃","hill":"C11H15N5O3","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"H":15.0,"N":5.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Galidesivir","uk":"Галідесивір"},"descriptions":{"en":"Galidesivir (BCX4430, immucillin-A) is an antiviral drug, an adenosine analog (a type of nucleoside analog). It was developed by BioCryst Pharmaceuticals with funding from NIAID, originally intended as a treatment for hepatitis C, but subsequently developed as a potential treatment for deadly filovirus infections such as Ebola virus disease and Marburg virus disease, as well as Zika virus. Currently, galidesivir is under phase 1 human trial in Brazil for coronavirus.","uk":"Галідесивір (англ. Galidesivir, інші назви BCX4430, Іммуцилін А) — синтетичний противірусний препарат, який є нуклеозидним аналогом (похідним аденозину). Препарат розроблений компанією «BioCryst Pharmaceuticals» за фінансової участі Національного інституту алергії та інфекційних хвороб США, спочатку розроблений для лікування гепатиту C, але згодом досліджувався як потенційний засіб для лікування небезпечних філовірусних інфекцій, таких як гарячка Ебола, гарячка Марбург та гарячки Зіка."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":69211190,"mass":301.73,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=C(C2=C(N1)C(=NC=N2)N)[C@H]3[C@@H]([C@@H]([C@H](N3)CO)O)O.Cl","inchikey":"PCCHVYNGFMEGIG-QPAIBFMUSA-N","iupac":"(2S,3S,4R,5R)-2-(4-amino-5H-pyrrolo[3,2-d]pyrimidin-7-yl)-5-(hydroxymethyl)pyrrolidine-3,4-diol;hydrochloride","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18209997","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galidesivir","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%96%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B2%D1%96%D1%80","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/69211190","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q12910980","formula":"C₁₆H₂₂N₆O₄","names":{"en":"Thyrotropin-releasing hormone","ru":"Тиролиберин"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":35,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q425296","formula":"C₁₉H₂₁N₅O₄","names":{"en":"Prazosin","ru":"Празозин","uk":"Празозин"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":27,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q418586","formula":"C₁₂H₁₅N₅O₃","names":{"en":"Entecavir","uk":"Ентекавір"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":26,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q422457","formula":"C₁₀H₁₃N₅O₃","names":{"en":"2'-deoxyadenosine"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":25,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q419939","formula":"C₂₃H₂₅N₅O₅","names":{"en":"Doxazosin","ru":"Доксазозин","uk":"Доксазозин"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":23,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q420364","formula":"C₁₀H₁₅N₅O₃","names":{"en":"Penciclovir","ru":"Пенцикловир","uk":"Пенцикловір"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":23,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q754986","formula":"C₁₄H₁₇N₅O₃","names":{"en":"Pipemidic acid","ru":"Пипемидовая кислота","uk":"Піпемідова кислота"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":22,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q422606","formula":"C₁₀H₁₂N₄O₃","names":{"en":"Didanosine","uk":"Диданозин"},"elements":["H","C","N","O"],"fame":21,"kind":"molecule"}],"photo":null}